Question ID:<br>GEO_U03_L05_Q12<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>Readiness Support Only<br><br>Question:<br>A proof gives AB &cong; DE, AC &cong; DF, and &angle;A &cong; &angle;D. Which criterion fits? {
